    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an epic adventure! You were once a powerful baron, but a dark mage accused you of treason and banished you into exile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it\u2019s time to change your fate! Fight your way back, defeat the sinister mage, and save the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you reclaim the honor and power that are rightfully yours? Your journey begins now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/f938c52a756e7916551e4c2762c712eb.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/f938c52a756e7916551e4c2762c712eb.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/8233a24989c01af12a1688c8ea410e8a.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/8233a24989c01af12a1688c8ea410e8a.webm?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your main weapon, a big axe, to defeat enemies. Collect exploding potions and use them agains your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.webm?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.mp4?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast world full of discoveries awaits you! Explore 24 different  levels across five unique worlds, each presenting exciting challenges. From endless desert landscapes and dense forests to majestic mountains and mysterious castles \u2013 experience breathtaking locations and embrace every adventure.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/495417a35b4ebea9d7059cd62a9e27f8.avif?t=1743355951\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BOSSFIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use all your skills to defeat powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/3ebdb05ade25dd848edc587fe88232da.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/3ebdb05ade25dd848edc587fe88232da.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET HELPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet friendly characters, which you can play and use new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/acf0ca4835cb5a7916a101fa4c1fe6d6.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/acf0ca4835cb5a7916a101fa4c1fe6d6.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/0ba6f9a9c5dc0dcd2dffc45bf2ff68e7.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/0ba6f9a9c5dc0dcd2dffc45bf2ff68e7.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In co-op multiplayer mode, you can enjoy your adventure with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE AWAITS YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to purchase powerful items from merchants. Hidden diamonds and various achievements will keep you engaged even after you've completed the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an epic adventure! You were once a powerful baron, but a dark mage accused you of treason and banished you into exile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it\u2019s time to change your fate! Fight your way back, defeat the sinister mage, and save the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you reclaim the honor and power that are rightfully yours? Your journey begins now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/f938c52a756e7916551e4c2762c712eb.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/f938c52a756e7916551e4c2762c712eb.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/8233a24989c01af12a1688c8ea410e8a.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/8233a24989c01af12a1688c8ea410e8a.webm?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your main weapon, a big axe, to defeat enemies. Collect exploding potions and use them agains your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.webm?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/570dde7fb748849650362b7e060099e2.mp4?t=1743355951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast world full of discoveries awaits you! Explore 24 different  levels across five unique worlds, each presenting exciting challenges. From endless desert landscapes and dense forests to majestic mountains and mysterious castles \u2013 experience breathtaking locations and embrace every adventure.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/495417a35b4ebea9d7059cd62a9e27f8.avif?t=1743355951\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BOSSFIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use all your skills to defeat powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/3ebdb05ade25dd848edc587fe88232da.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/3ebdb05ade25dd848edc587fe88232da.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET HELPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet friendly characters, which you can play and use new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/acf0ca4835cb5a7916a101fa4c1fe6d6.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/acf0ca4835cb5a7916a101fa4c1fe6d6.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/0ba6f9a9c5dc0dcd2dffc45bf2ff68e7.poster.avif?t=1743355951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/0ba6f9a9c5dc0dcd2dffc45bf2ff68e7.apng?t=1743355951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In co-op multiplayer mode, you can enjoy your adventure with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE AWAITS YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to purchase powerful items from merchants. Hidden diamonds and various achievements will keep you engaged even after you've completed the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the thrilling action of Baron of Blood, a captivating 2D platformer with retro pixel art visuals. Battle your way through exhilarating levels, vanquishing monsters and ghouls along the way. Gather coins to unlock powerful items that will aid you on your epic adventure.",
